# Line endings
# ════════════
# SQL here is executed verbatim by psql, and a carriage return inside a
# dollar-quoted function body becomes PART OF THE STORED FUNCTION SOURCE.
# With core.autocrlf=true on Windows, a checkout would otherwise install
# functions whose md5(prosrc) differs from production — see
# db/roles/EXTRACT_rls_auto_enable.md. Pin SQL to LF everywhere.
*.sql text eol=lf

# Shell scripts must not gain CRs either: a trailing \r makes the shebang and
# every command fail on Linux/CI.
*.sh text eol=lf
